n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries on HTTP 503, up to 3 attempts in total. Waits between attempts are 0.5s then 1.0s (exponential backoff).\n\nI checked it against a local test server:\n\n| Server behaviour | Result | Requests |\n|---|---|---|\n| 503 twice, then 200 | Returns the data | 3 |\n| 503 every time | Raises `HTTPError` 503 | 3 |\n| 404 | Raises `HTTPError` 404 straight away | 1 |\n\n- **Other errors:** Only 503 is retried. Other HTTP errors and network errors (timeouts, connection refused) are raised immediately.\n- **New parameters:** `WeatherClient.__init__` gained two optional parameters, `attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5` (the base delay in seconds). Existing callers don't need to change.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 104836, "requests_cache_write": 72519, "requests_cost_usd": 0.2059551, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1415, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial28", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 115, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-18T00:47:29.448736+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 15.254, "t_checker_s": 2.38, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1427, "tokens_cache_read": 104836, "tokens_cache_write": 72519, "tokens_fresh": 1427, "tokens_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_cache_read": 104836, "tokens_main_cache_write": 72519, "tokens_main_calls": 5, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_output": 1